**Pre-registration precedence, from the commit graph rather than from memory.** The intervention's
pre-registration is commit `{{lf_pr005_commit}}` at {{lf_pr005_time}}, and the first steered token
followed {{lf_pr005_lead}} later. The follow-up's is `{{lf_pr006_commit}}` at {{lf_pr006_time}},
